  "description": "## 💀 🌊Forgotten Tavern 🏊💀\n\nSwim. Strengthen. Conquer - Forgotten&#039;s Pool Subsidiary\n \n### ✨ Features\n- Active main guild (Once you reach cl lvl 100 you can join it)\n- Selfmade world boss timer via discord\n \n### ✔️ Requirements\n- Pay every contribution share in gold (For challenges &amp; repairing Pool + Beacon)\n\n### 📅 Pool Schedule \n- **4:00 PM CET** (Dynamic pool for citadel WBs)\n \n ### 💬 Discord\n- Join our discord server to apply, get news &amp; information and chat with us: https://discord.gg/kCKdJmckxC\n\n ### 🏰 Other Forgotten Guilds\n- Forgotten CL 100+\n- Forgotten Watch CL 92+\n- Forgotten Vanguard CL 80 - 91\n- Forgotten Dawn CL 60 - 79\n- Forgotten Order CL 25 - 59\n- Forgotten Knights/Horde - Dedicated Assault Guilds",
